  "implementationDetails": {
    "audioStrategy": "Single AudioContext architecture feeding two Piano layer buses (A, B) with per-layer Timbre EQ, model voicing, and ordered Layer Effects chains (Mod 1 -> Mod 2 -> Delay -> Amp Sim/EQ -> Compressor -> Reverb), plus one shared Rotary Speaker reached post-Reverb via To Rotary, layer levels, Master Level gain, soft-knee DynamicsCompressorNode limiter, and brickwall WaveShaperNode safety clipper to one destination. Grand (78 stereo OGG), Upright (52 stereo OGG), Rhodes Mk I (15 mono OGG), and Wurlitzer EP200 (25 mono OGG) are bundled recorded cuts from inputs/samples/ (170 files total). Clav, Digital, Misc piano types, sympathetic string resonance, reverb impulse responses, and the labeled sample-failure fallback are live/generated Web Audio synthesis.",
